    {
      "heading": "Supporting product content",
      "group": "supporting-content",
      "text": "5 stars: 6 (60%) 4 stars: 4 (40%) 3 stars: 0 (0%) 2 stars: 0 (0%) 1 star: 0 (0%) S Sandeep Kumar Old Mattress Feels New My mattress had become a little uncomfortable over time. Adding the Memory Foam Topper made it feel almost like a new mattress. Good product for the price. A Aishwarya Nair Nice Addition To Bed I bought this because my mattress was feeling a bit firm. The Memory Foam Topper has definitely made it more comfortable, although I expected it to be slightly thicker. D Divya Krishnan Comfortable From Day One The topper was easy to put on the mattress and felt comfortable from the first night. My bed feels softer now and I have been sleeping quite well. M Meera Shah Soft And Cozy Feel I wanted something to make my mattress a little softer and this worked well. The Memory Foam Topper gives a nice cozy feel without making the bed too soft. S Sneha Kulkarni Good Mattress Upgrade The Memory Foam Topper has improved the feel of my old mattress quite a bit. It is comfortable and easy to use. Took some time to settle, but overall a good purchase. R Rahul Verma Much Better Sleep I was using an old mattress and didn’t want to replace it yet, so I tried this Memory Foam Topper. It made a noticeable difference and feels much more comfortable now. M Manish Gupta Comfortable For Sleeping Overall, I’m happy with the topper. It gives good cushioning and feels comfortable during the night. It would have been better if it had a little more firmness. P Pooja Sharma Really Comfortable Topper Bought this for my bedroom and have been using it for a few weeks. The Memory Foam Topper feels soft and comfortable, especially when sleeping on my side. A Arjun Reddy Good For Daily Use I wasn’t expecting such a big difference, but my mattress feels much better with this topper. It is comfortable for everyday use and I’m happy with the purchase. N Nikhil Bansal Good Overall Comfort The topper is comfortable and has made my mattress better for sleeping. I just felt it took a couple of days to get used to the feel."
